      "text": "<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Elite</span></span><span class=\"futura-bold\"><sup><span class=\"fontsize-8em\">*</span></sup></span><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"> performance</span>&nbsp;for ease-of-opening with less manipulation</span></h2>\n",
